top-sort [s_acctbal desc, n_name asc, s_name asc, p_partkey asc] limit 100
└─ project (s_acctbal, s_name, n_name, p_partkey, p_mfgr, s_address, s_phone, s_comment) (rows≈1 cost≈37K)
   └─ join inner [nation.n_regionkey = region.r_regionkey] (rows≈1 cost≈36.9K)
      ├─ join inner [supplier.s_nationkey = nation.n_nationkey] emit-filter 1 from left (rows≈1 cost≈32.4K)
      │  ├─ join inner [partsupp.ps_suppkey = supplier.s_suppkey] emit-filter 2 from left (rows≈1 cost≈27.8K)
      │  │  ├─ join inner [part.p_partkey = __corr_0_0__, partsupp.ps_supplycost = __scalar_0__] (rows≈1 cost≈22.7K)
